{"3525440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cloak And Coin", "steam_appid": 3525440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE THIEVES GUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/e10fc945fceb80ff54ea592d2606aac8.poster.avif?t=1786148071\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/e10fc945fceb80ff54ea592d2606aac8.webm?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/e10fc945fceb80ff54ea592d2606aac8.mp4?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOB: GET IN, GET PAID.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go in alone or form a crew of up to 4 players and sneak into dangerous locations across the world of Marfit. Steal valuable loot, escape with your earnings, and secure enough gold to fund your chosen <strong>Finale</strong>, the ultimate high-stakes heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your contracts wisely. Every contract attempted brings you closer and closer to the finale heist, whether you succeed or fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/1ef48c49618b77c9dc04a4a55e517a0b.poster.avif?t=1786148071\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/1ef48c49618b77c9dc04a4a55e517a0b.webm?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/1ef48c49618b77c9dc04a4a55e517a0b.mp4?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>UNPREDICTABLE HEISTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every heist is different. Random mission modifiers, changing loot spawns, and different enemy types can turn your perfect heist into a desperate escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/85613e01ce2766ae281ae4a423a2f2b6.poster.avif?t=1786148071\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/85613e01ce2766ae281ae4a423a2f2b6.webm?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/85613e01ce2766ae281ae4a423a2f2b6.mp4?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROFESSIONAL TOOLS FOR AMATEUR THIEVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is about your tools, not your stats. Spend your hard earned gold to expand your personal arsenal and prepare for the heists ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Shovels to stun unexpected Guards, Lock Melters to quietly open doors, Smoke Bombs to break line of sight, and much much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/002372e2ccb30ac05f449a7cae311591.poster.avif?t=1786148071\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/002372e2ccb30ac05f449a7cae311591.webm?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/002372e2ccb30ac05f449a7cae311591.mp4?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLO OR CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re going in alone or with a crew of up to 4 players, the heist of a lifetime is always within reach, as long as you can actually pull it off.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE THIEVES GUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/e10fc945fceb80ff54ea592d2606aac8.poster.avif?t=1786148071\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/e10fc945fceb80ff54ea592d2606aac8.webm?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/e10fc945fceb80ff54ea592d2606aac8.mp4?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOB: GET IN, GET PAID.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go in alone or form a crew of up to 4 players and sneak into dangerous locations across the world of Marfit. Steal valuable loot, escape with your earnings, and secure enough gold to fund your chosen <strong>Finale</strong>, the ultimate high-stakes heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your contracts wisely. Every contract attempted brings you closer and closer to the finale heist, whether you succeed or fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/1ef48c49618b77c9dc04a4a55e517a0b.poster.avif?t=1786148071\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/1ef48c49618b77c9dc04a4a55e517a0b.webm?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/1ef48c49618b77c9dc04a4a55e517a0b.mp4?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>UNPREDICTABLE HEISTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every heist is different. Random mission modifiers, changing loot spawns, and different enemy types can turn your perfect heist into a desperate escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/85613e01ce2766ae281ae4a423a2f2b6.poster.avif?t=1786148071\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/85613e01ce2766ae281ae4a423a2f2b6.webm?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/85613e01ce2766ae281ae4a423a2f2b6.mp4?t=1786148071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROFESSIONAL TOOLS FOR AMATEUR THIEVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is about your tools, not your stats. Spend your hard earned gold to expand your personal arsenal and prepare for the heists ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Shovels to stun unexpected Guards, Lock Melters to quietly open doors, Smoke Bombs to break line of sight, and much much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/002372e2ccb30ac05f449a7cae311591.poster.avif?t=1786148071\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525440/extras/002372e2ccb30ac05f449a7cae311591.webm?t=1786148